{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is double their geometric mean, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faaa8e0ee4c7cc10efb7957393ffcba8ba661bca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />, then a possible value for the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0c22354f6f8870c3a024305aa3afed00b26bcf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a/b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />, to the nearest integer, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbc4f724d21cacdd718c40d751b6d2fb5c6662b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 5\\quad \\text{(B) } 8\\quad \\text{(C) } 11\\quad \\text{(D) } 14\\quad \\text{(E) none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"368\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/8884023857dfc0fec698591f45b5672cdc87f2b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{2}=2\\cdot\\sqrt{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"122\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f4a89039c7a9fc3b56ac9a69f6c64f3f7e51ab4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} +1=4\\cdot\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"123\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a7dbfedf0ca6fa0e07a6c7a2d1b897a29243433.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"66\" height=\"43\" /> we get a quadratic equation is<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/5/4759a1249b15388f7409117372b18f4944a37001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+1=4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" /> with solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/c/23cf5c176db4ee6bac1607856bcc64f36e5e61af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{4\\pm \\sqrt{16-4}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"132\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/756d1a43d050192e198dfca3698c42d4b4af8db8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=\\frac{a}{b}=(4+3)+4\\sqrt{3}=13.8=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"289\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 